    "detailed_description": "<i>Comic action and platform game, set in northeastern Brazil, with the presence of myths and legends from folklore and a visual style based on cordel literature.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venture forth in northeastern Brazil</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769020/extras/343a4ef2a93e0bc8fd49ec985bae54ab.poster.avif?t=1739190144\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769020/extras/343a4ef2a93e0bc8fd49ec985bae54ab.webm?t=1739190144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769020/extras/343a4ef2a93e0bc8fd49ec985bae54ab.mp4?t=1739190144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free the inhabitants, fauna and creatures from evil spirits</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769020/extras/905d6da9b7782e3b9f34017d4d5424ef.poster.avif?t=1739190144\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769020/extras/905d6da9b7782e3b9f34017d4d5424ef.webm?t=1739190144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769020/extras/905d6da9b7782e3b9f34017d4d5424ef.mp4?t=1739190144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new areas on the map</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769020/extras/193ae48af29676dbe1598f1571ad9134.poster.avif?t=1739190144\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769020/extras/193ae48af296